Z||000005||Cheever3000||09-18-2001||12:50 PM||||turbo86: on my 'puter, I just right-click on the zipped file folder and select "extract all".  <P>gareth: it's the Pennock's Image Poster blue box at the bottom of every screen.  I printed it out before doing anything.  Take your time and do exactly as instructed.<P>||||reg||1
